flowchart LR
    Client[Client / ERP app]
    API[Fastify API\nPOST /v1/documents/pdf\nPOST /v1/batches\nGET /v1/batches/:jobId]
    PG[(PostgreSQL\npdf_jobs / pdf_outbox)]
    Redis[(Redis\nBullMQ queue)]
    Renderer[Puppeteer PDF renderer]
    Worker[Bulk worker]
    Storage[Storage jobs directory]
    ZIP[ZIP archive + manifest.json + manifest.sig]
    Manifest[Ed25519 verification]

    Client -->|HTTP JSON| API
    API -->|single PDF render| Renderer
    API -->|persist batch metadata + outbox| PG
    API -->|download status| PG
    API -->|read artifact| Storage

    PG -->|pending events| Outbox[Transactional outbox dispatcher]
    Outbox -->|enqueue| Redis
    Redis -->|process-bulk job| Worker
    Worker -->|SELECT pending batch| PG
    Worker -->|render each document| Renderer
    Worker -->|write PDFs + archive| Storage
    Storage --> ZIP
    Worker -->|manifest signed| Manifest
    Worker -->|status updates| PG
    Client -->|download ZIP| ZIP
